flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read n/]
    B --> C{n ≤ 0?}
    C -->|Yes| D[/Print Invalid input/]
    D --> Z([Stop])
    C -->|No| E[sum ← 0, fact ← 1]
    E --> F[i ← 1]
    F --> G{i ≤ n?}
    G -->|Yes| H[fact ← fact × i]
    H --> I[term ← i / fact]
    I --> J[sum ← sum + term]
    J --> K[/Print term/]
    K --> L[i ← i + 1]
    L --> G
    G -->|No| M[/Print sum/]
    M --> Z
